# "24 Quant Books.md" is 27 MB of extracted body text from textbooks that are
# still in copyright (Hull, López de Prado, Hilpisch and others). It was
# reading material for building the course; it is not the course, and
# publishing it would be straightforward infringement. Keep it out.
